"""Design-case proposals for WO Board & Tech View (Rule 126) — data only. build_design_look.py fills the PRD quotes
(verbatim, by rule code, from the saved PRD v52 text) and the measured design values, and writes the JSON.

Every attribute is written as something a manual tester can SEE with the product UI and the named design picture side by
side at 100% zoom (QA lead 14 Oct night: "runnable by the manual QA tester ... always"). Where the design gives a pixel value
it is shown as the design value AND paired with an eye check (a visible relation or the picture); nothing asks the tester to
measure with a tool. Pixel-exact checks a person cannot judge are kept as visible comparisons and the case carries
AUTOMATION: READY so automation can measure them.
"""

PRD = "PRD Confluence 845185030 version 52 (14 Oct 2026, Chris Ward), saved build/wo-board-tech-view/po-defects-2026-10-14/CONFLUENCE-845185030-now-2026-10-14.md"
DESIGN = "Claude Design project \"Work Orders\" (Branko Cicovic), export of 14 Oct 2026, board \"Work Orders.dc.html\""

COMMON_PRE = [
    "You are signed in as {User-A} (for example Admin ShopView), a user whose role has Work orders > View, Work orders > Create & Edit and See financial data, at {Location-A} (for example Staging Heavy Duty - 9919).",
    "Your browser window is 1440 px wide at 100% browser zoom (for example a full-screen 1440 × 900 laptop window); steps that say 1536 px use a window 1536 px wide.",
    "Technician {Technician-A} (for example Esther Howard) is an active technician at {Location-A} with a profile photo.",
    "Technician {Technician-B} (for example Brenda Martinez) is an active technician at {Location-A} with no profile photo.",
    "Technician {Technician-C} (for example Ralph Edwards) is an active technician at {Location-A}.",
    "Work order {Work-order-1} (for example S2-17435) is Approved, led by {Technician-A}, has progress above 0% (for example 15%), a service advisor (for example James Smith) and one line, {Line-1} (for example \"Service - PM-A inspection\"), whose technician is {Technician-C}.",
    "Work order {Work-order-2} (for example S2-17440) is Invoiced and led by {Technician-B}.",
    "Work order {Work-order-3} (for example S2-17441) is an Estimate with no lead technician, so the Unassigned group holds at least one work order.",
    "Work order {Work-order-4} (for example S2-17442) is In progress, led by {Technician-C}, with a technician clocked in to one of its lines.",
    "Density is Regular (the default) and no filter, search or Assigned to me is active on the Work Orders page.",
    "The design picture named in this case is open beside the app at 100% zoom (it is attached to the case).",
]
VIEW_ONLY_PRE = "User {User-B} (for example ZZAUTOTEST Viewer) has Work orders > View but not Work orders > Create & Edit, at {Location-A}."

P = []


def add(**k):
    P.append(k)


